and it is not all under one licence. This file states honestly what came from
where, so that anyone reusing it knows what they are actually allowed to do.

## 1. This fork's own contributions — MIT

Copyright (c) 2026 datom. See LICENSE.

This covers the work added in this fork, which is the larger part of the
current source tree: the whole web interface, the C-ITS message decoding
(CAM / DENM / SPATEM / MAPEM and the VDV R09.16 public-transport telegram),
