The files were adapted rather than copied verbatim: the disconnect cache moved
to PSRAM, the frame buffers are allocated there too, the DENM classification
uses this fork's own decoder, the NVS persistence of the duty cycle was removed,
and several defects were fixed (a client that connects without subscribing could
pause the sniffer indefinitely; the duty-cycle characteristic accepted values
that parked reception near zero). Those changes are this fork's, under section 1.

